{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52501","headline":"江上覊情 · 刘希夷","name":"江上覊情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独下三江路，飘如一叶浮。\n卧查冲险洑，欹树压平流。\n岸枝时冒挽，潬沙或碍舟。\n出没见帆影，远近闻棹讴。\n浦花春似雪，江气晓如秋。\n白云乖帝里，舟徼（下缺。\n以上二首均见伯二六七三卷）（按：以上二诗原收於刘希夷《北邙篇》之次，疑亦爲其所作，姑收希夷下，俟考。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52501.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52501","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}